  "bodyHash": "871d2a6cf7655be7",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>自动采矿机</h1>\n<h3>安装要求</h3>\n<h3><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-size:16px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://neoforged.net/img/authors/neoforged.png\" alt=\"NeoForge\" width=\"120\"></a></h3>\n<p>此版本的自动采矿机基于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a> 运行。在将自动采矿机添加至游戏前，请先安装加载器。<br><br></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b70174e4-8263-469f-8528-cec447591c52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"593\" height=\"157\"></p>\n<h3>关于</h3>\n<p>自动采矿机是一款允许您自动挖掘矿石的模组。该模组包含多个等级的采矿机，等级越高开采速度越快。</p>\n<h3>合成配方</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>焊锡 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_34f2d9ba-3f59-4f7d-a36f-6ff89f6ca588.png\" width=\"174\" height=\"95\"><br><br></li>\n<li>纤维&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cbc1e478-3ec6-4bbb-bb72-e189e979f5c7.png\" width=\"175\" height=\"105\"><br><br></li>\n<li>精细切割石英 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_70f7c566-0e95-4e0a-abca-ac6c622bae53.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"117\"><br><br></li>\n<li>雕刻树脂&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f43c3cc1-a04e-4c13-908f-eb1d62072be8.png\" width=\"349\" height=\"114\"><br><br></li>\n<li>绝缘板 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e9e3f2c5-87e7-4d26-bc44-53f8171de286.png\" width=\"329\" height=\"105\"><br><br></li>\n<li>粗芯片 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c02c86c8-4169-432c-9e9e-585ee106d548.png\" width=\"281\" height=\"116\"><br><br></li>\n<li>铜线 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6ce61f08-26f7-4fe9-a808-553ad8f72290.png\" width=\"348\" height=\"105\"><br><br></li>\n<li>电路板 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b567783a-98bd-45fb-b3f1-f79d3c374394.png\" width=\"277\" height=\"118\"><br><br></li>\n<li>钻头 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_652034c4-95af-4fc1-b139-46064c1bd56f.png\" width=\"228\" height=\"103\"><br><br></li>\n<li>采矿机 T1 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d443cdf0-371d-4a1b-ab70-7373a964787b.png\" width=\"422\" height=\"104\"><br><br></li>\n<li>采矿机 T2 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5d0ed004-ca7a-4fa5-886f-6a902b901e39.png\" width=\"440\" height=\"116\"><br><br></li>\n<li>采矿机 T3 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3ca80b72-34f2-4d66-912c-62964a45f9b8.png\" width=\"382\" height=\"105\"><br><br></li>\n<li>采矿机 T4 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9d8699b6-ef97-4078-9ff2-48595e37a385.png\" width=\"446\" height=\"105\"><br><br></li>\n<li>采矿机 T5 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e85a2a17-f0c9-42bf-94bd-c36e5daa9353.png\" width=\"423\" height=\"106\"><br><br></li>\n<li>升级器 T1 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c605336d-493f-453a-a056-3fdead49694c.png\" width=\"289\" height=\"99\"><br><br></li>\n<li>升级器 T2 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_69261a92-28db-4f7d-b8cf-b07f49b3d439.png\" width=\"281\" height=\"96\"></li>\n</ol>\n<p>开采速度<br>采矿机 T1：每 100 刻产出 1 个<br>采矿机 T2：每 40 刻产出 1 个<br>采矿机 T3：每 20 刻产出 1 个<br>采矿机 T4：每 5 刻产出 1 个<br>采矿机 T5：每 1 刻产出 1 个</p>\n<p>必须在采矿机上方放置一个桶</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
